      "type": "event",
      "date": "2025-12-19T12:39:00.000Z",
      "title": "National Fertilizers Limited Appoints Shri Anurag Rohatgi as Additional Director (Government Nominee Director) on the Board, Effective December 19, 2025",
      "body": "National Fertilizers Limited informed that Shri Anurag Rohatgi has been appointed as an Additional Director (Government Nominee Director) on the Board of the Company w.e.f. 19 December 2025 vice Shri Bharat Shushan, in terms of Order No. 95/1/2019-HR-PSU(Part-2) (e-31042) dated 18 December 2025 issued by Department of Fertilizers, Ministry of Chemicals & Fertilizers, Government of India. He was born in September, 1970. He holds a Master's degree in Chemistry. He is also a Director on the Board of Hindustan Fertilizer Corporation Limited. Further, he had been an Additional Director in Hindustan Urvarak & Rasayan Limited (HURL) . Sh. Rohatgi's work expenence includes International Cooperation, Fertilizer Innovation, P&K Fertilizers, Non-Chemical (Organic) Fertilizers, PMKSKs, Chintan Shivir,",
      "keyDevTypeId": "16",
